{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26030","headline":"闻蝉 · 鲍溶","name":"闻蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高蝉旦夕唳，景物浮凉气。\n木叶渐惊年，锦字因络纬。\n稍断当窗梦，更凄临水意。\n清香笋蒂风，晓露莲花泪。\n余引未全歇，凝悲寻迥至。\n星井欲望河，月扇看藏笥。\n谁念因声感，放歌写人事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}